  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpottedNote
  note: 'You''ve been spotted. Guards fight back hard: the blade can win a straight
    fight, but the club does nothing to a guard who has seen you, and there''s no
    blocking. A Sleep Dart still drops him. Or break his line of sight: run, or Teleport
    into a shadow, and he searches where he last saw you. A red cap who loses you
    runs for the alarm.'
